<title>USA: Tenet Healthcare Corp Q3 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Tenet Healthcare Corp Q3 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		    $0.37   profit	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net loss		  113,300   profit	98,100</p>
<p> Revs		    2,236,900		1,972,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  305,267		  299,284</p>
<p>			9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $0.28   profit	 $1.52</p>
<p> Net profit		 85,500   profit     435,100</p>
<p> Revs		    6,339,400		5,603,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  302,915		  286,284</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 net includes merger-related expenses of $0.06/shr in Q3 and $0.61/shr for nine months.</p>
<p>Q3 and nine months 1997 net includes $0.16/shr extraordinary charge for early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>Nine months 1996 net includes $0.62/shr gain on dispositions.</p>
<p>Oper shr, excluding above items is profit $0.39 vs profit $0.33 for Q3 and profit $1.05 vs profit $0.90 for nine months.</p>
<p>Period ended Feb 28.</p>
</text>
